    "All 43 original closed/comparison Prof observations are unchanged, including actual inverse data, shaped eval/lambda computation, weighted-limit/colimit classifier checks and adjoint preservation inputs.",
    "The existing caveat about missing general end/coend identifications is retained. Type formation is not upgraded to a derived cone/cocone or Kan-extension theorem.",
    "Homd leaf, constant-family and fibre-transport observations use their actual Cat_cart coefficient.",
    "The first higher section action uses the actual total-dual index O(Hom_K(x,y)) and total-dual Homd family. Its value remains the existing fdapp1_int_hom_fapp0 projection.",
    "The whole Sigma-Hom uses outer total duality, a total-dual base index and the total-dual Homd family. The Sigma-map first Hom uses the existing Homd_index_sigma_func applied to the actual P(I) arrow.",
    "General eta/s remain lax displayed maps/sections. Sigma objects/arrows and contextual pair/substitution computations retain all original base maps, fibre data and higher action.",
    "The final relative section observations use homd_int(s) composed with s, the actual computed root target, Q-valued y-evaluation and the whole presheaf view. They do not apply Op_funcd to raw s.",
    "The installed constant-index action already makes piapp1_fapp0 for a constant family compute to the ordinary F[p]. Its old negative becomes positive; the existing independent arbitrary-loop controls remain.",
    "No primitive, rewrite, unifier, profile, new witness, operational equality-proof argument or global diagnostic declaration is added."
  ],
